# @ant-design/pro-components@3.0.0-beta.3 still declares `antd@^5.11.2` as a peer
# dependency while this app runs antd 6, so a plain `npm install` / `npm ci` aborts
# with ERESOLVE. The only thing we use from that package is ProConfigProvider, a
# pass-through wrapper, and it works against antd 6; keep the installer from failing
# on the stale peer range instead of downgrading antd.
# 注意：这条掩盖了该子树里所有的 peer 冲突；退出条件见 docs/known-issues.md 第 10 条。
legacy-peer-deps=true
